(1. Purpose) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(This document explains how security and access should work for Edgecipline in plain) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 706 Tm
(English. It is written for a founder, product owner, or early engineering team that needs) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 692 Tm
(to understand who can access what, how user data is protected, what errors should look) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 678 Tm
(like, and what edge cases must be handled before launch.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 664 Tm
(Edgecipline stores sensitive user data:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 650 Tm
(- Personal account details.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 636 Tm
(- Trading history.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 622 Tm
(- Trading screenshots.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 608 Tm
(- Payment and subscription records.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 594 Tm
(- Psychology and behavioral trading notes.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 580 Tm
(- Admin actions and feedback.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 566 Tm
(The security goal is simple:) Tj
/FR 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 76 552 Tm
(Every user should only see and change their own trading data, admins should have) Tj
/FR 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 76 536 Tm
(controlled operational access, and sensitive failures should be handled without) Tj
/FR 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 76 520 Tm
(leaking private information.) Tj
/FR 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 34 Tm
(Edgecipline Security | 3) Tj
