BT
/FB 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 742 Tm
(2. Recommended Authentication Method) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(Best Fit For This App) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 703 Tm
(Use a hybrid authentication model:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 689 Tm
(- Email/password login for normal accounts.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 675 Tm
(- Google sign-in through Firebase for users who prefer OAuth.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 661 Tm
(- Backend-issued short-lived JWT access tokens for API requests.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 647 Tm
(- Backend-issued rotating refresh tokens stored as secure httpOnly cookies.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 633 Tm
(- Separate admin authentication using a different admin JWT secret.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 619 Tm
(This is the best fit because Edgecipline is both a web app and mobile-wrapped app. Users) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 605 Tm
(need convenient login, while the backend still needs strong control over access to trade) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 591 Tm
(data, uploads, payments, and admin tools.) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 577 Tm
(How Login Should Work) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 560 Tm
(1. User logs in with email/password or Google.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 546 Tm
(2. Backend verifies the login.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 532 Tm
(3. Backend returns a short-lived access token.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 518 Tm
(4. Backend sets a long-lived refresh token in an httpOnly cookie.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 504 Tm
(5. Frontend sends the access token with API calls.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 490 Tm
(6. When the access token expires, the frontend silently refreshes it using the) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 476 Tm
(   refresh cookie.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 462 Tm
(7. Refresh tokens rotate every time they are used.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 448 Tm
(8. If a reused refresh token is detected, the whole session family is revoked.) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 434 Tm
(Why This Is Secure) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 417 Tm
(- Access tokens expire quickly, so stolen tokens have a short lifetime.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 403 Tm
(- Refresh tokens are stored hashed in the database, not as raw tokens.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 389 Tm
(- Refresh tokens are kept in httpOnly cookies, so normal frontend JavaScript cannot) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 375 Tm
(  read them.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 361 Tm
(- Token rotation detects replay attacks.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 347 Tm
(- tokenVersion lets the backend invalidate all active sessions after password reset) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 333 Tm
(  or logout-all.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 319 Tm
(- Admin tokens use a different secret, so user tokens cannot accidentally become) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 305 Tm
(  admin tokens.) Tj
/FR 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 34 Tm
(Edgecipline Security | 4) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
