(3. Password And Account Security Rules) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(Password Requirements) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 703 Tm
(Passwords should require:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 689 Tm
(- At least 8 characters.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 675 Tm
(- At least one uppercase letter.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 661 Tm
(- At least one lowercase letter.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 647 Tm
(- At least one number.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 633 Tm
(- At least one special character.) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 619 Tm
(Login Protection) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 602 Tm
(After repeated failed login attempts:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 588 Tm
(- Lock the account temporarily.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 574 Tm
(- Return a neutral error message.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 560 Tm
(- Do not reveal whether the email exists.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 546 Tm
(Current recommended rule:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 532 Tm
(- 5 failed attempts locks the account for 15 minutes.) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 518 Tm
(Password Reset Protection) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 501 Tm
(Password reset should use OTP with these rules:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 487 Tm
(- Store only a hashed OTP in the database.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 473 Tm
(- OTP expires after 10 minutes.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 459 Tm
(- Limit failed OTP attempts.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 445 Tm
(- After OTP verification, issue a short-lived reset token.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 431 Tm
(- Clear the OTP immediately after successful verification.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 417 Tm
(- After password reset, revoke all refresh tokens and increment tokenVersion.) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 403 Tm
(Google Login Rules) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 386 Tm
(- Only accept verified Google emails.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 372 Tm
(- Only accept Google as the sign-in provider.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 358 Tm
(- Do not silently convert password accounts into Google accounts.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 344 Tm
(- If an email is already registered with password login, Google login should be) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 330 Tm
(  rejected with a clear message.) Tj
/FR 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 34 Tm
(Edgecipline Security | 5) Tj
ET
endstream
