stream
BT
/FB 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 742 Tm
(13. Founder-Friendly Security Policy) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(For version one, use this policy:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 706 Tm
(1. Users own their data.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 692 Tm
(2. Every user-owned record must be queried with the logged-in user's ID.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 678 Tm
(3. Admins can support users, but admin access must be separate and limited.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 664 Tm
(4. Passwords, OTPs, and refresh tokens must never be stored or logged in raw form.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 650 Tm
(5. Payment status can only change after verified payment or explicit admin action.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 636 Tm
